    "title": "🚧 No San Bernardino Line trains Sept. 26-27, 2026",
    "text": "21 hours ago 🚧 San Bernardino Line trains shut down Sept. 26–27\nMetrolink will not run any trains on the San Bernardino Line on Saturday, Sept. 26 and Sunday, Sept. 27, 2026 because of a track closure for safety projects .\nKey details:\nNo service: All San Bernardino Line trains canceled both days No alternate buses or trains are being provided Reason: Track work to support rail safety Questions? Call 800-371-5465 If you usually ride the San Bernardino Line , plan ahead and arrange other transportation for those two days.\nMore Info: Alerts, Service Advisories and Planned Advisories ...\nThis article includes content summarized and organized with AI tools, which can make mistakes. Learn more.",
